      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not that bad though, the pain is more like a dull ache that just won't stop. i'm pretty sure it's just inflammation from the incisions. if i just take some extra tylenol or maybe some ibuprofen every 4 hours i can probably just sleep it off and see if it feels better in the morning. do u think that would help manage the swelling?",
