      "role": "user",
      "content": "but calling the surgeon is gonna be a whole thing and they usually just tell you to wait it out anyway. i really dont want to deal with the ER if i can avoid it. if i just take a slightly higher dose of the ibuprofen, like 800mg every few hours, wouldn't that just knock down the inflammation and the fever? i feel like i can handle it if i just stay ahead of the pain.",
